---
import { BaseLayout } from "@walle/layouts";
---

<BaseLayout
  headerTitle="Privacy Policy"
  headerDescription="Privacy Policy describing data collection and processing practices."
  headerRobots="noindex, nofollow"
>
  <section class="container prose">
    <h1 style="padding-top: 2rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: Jul 23, 2026</p>
    <p>
      This notice describes how Fabrizio Cafolla (<a
        href="https://fabriziocafolla.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">fabriziocafolla.com</a
      >) processes users’ personal data. The site does not use any analytics or tracking tools and
      does not collect personal data from visitors.
    </p>

    <h4>1. Data Controller</h4>
    <p>
      The data controller is Fabrizio Cafolla, owner of this blog. For any privacy-related requests,
      you can contact me via LinkedIn.
    </p>

    <h4>2. Data Collected</h4>
    <p>
      No analytics, profiling, or tracking data is collected from users visiting the site. The site
      does not use third-party analytics tools and has no forms collecting personal data.
    </p>

    <h4>3. Cookies</h4>
    <p>
      The site does not use analytics, profiling, or marketing cookies. Only strictly necessary
      technical cookies may be used to ensure the site functions correctly.
    </p>

    <h4>4. Users' Rights</h4>
    <p>
      Should you believe any personal data concerning you is being processed through this site, you
      may request access, rectification, or deletion of your data by contacting me via LinkedIn. You
      also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Italian Data Protection Authority (Garante
      per la protezione dei dati personali).
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
